{"4735640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Alarm112: Fire Unit", "steam_appid": 4735640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4874270], "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4735640/extras/ed2b792bcf8340850d55589bc98e5d8e.avif?t=1787768674\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4735640/extras_big/ed2b792bcf8340850d55589bc98e5d8e.avif?t=1787768674 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Take a look at the planned future updates for Alarm112: Fire Unit.</strong></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Alarm 112: Fire Unit</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚨 Every emergency call is a new decision.<br>⏱️ Every second can change the outcome of the operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alarm 112: Fire Unit</strong> is a simulation-strategy game where you manage rescue operations under intense time pressure. Step into the role of an emergency dispatch operator and command fire department units during dynamic rescue missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive emergency calls, analyze the situation, dispatch the appropriate units and react to events unfolding in real time. Every operation requires quick thinking, proper resource management and decision-making under extreme pressure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 Main Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚒 Manage fire department units</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📞 Emergency call system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ Diverse incidents and crisis situations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏱️ Time pressure and fast-paced decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 Strategic rescue operation management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚨 Realistic emergency dispatch atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From apartment fires and underground garage incidents to large-scale emergencies — every intervention is a new challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you make the right decision before it’s too late?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 Alarm 112: Fire Unit<br>Manage rescue operations under pressure.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Alarm 112: Fire Unit</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚨 Every emergency call is a new decision.<br>⏱️ Every second can change the outcome of the operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alarm 112: Fire Unit</strong> is a simulation-strategy game where you manage rescue operations under intense time pressure. Step into the role of an emergency dispatch operator and command fire department units during dynamic rescue missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive emergency calls, analyze the situation, dispatch the appropriate units and react to events unfolding in real time. Every operation requires quick thinking, proper resource management and decision-making under extreme pressure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 Main Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚒 Manage fire department units</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📞 Emergency call system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ Diverse incidents and crisis situations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏱️ Time pressure and fast-paced decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 Strategic rescue operation management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚨 Realistic emergency dispatch atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From apartment fires and underground garage incidents to large-scale emergencies — every intervention is a new challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you make the right decision before it’s too late?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 Alarm 112: Fire Unit<br>Manage rescue operations under pressure.</p>", "short_description": "Comma